    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald is delighted to present No. 45 Milltown Hall, Mount Saint Anne's to the market. This superb ground floor apartment offers generously proportioned accommodation throughout, complemented by an exceptionally manicured setting within this highly sought-after development.\n\nExtending to approximately 85 sq. m., the accommodation briefly comprises a welcoming entrance hall leading to a spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining room. The fully fitted kitchen is thoughtfully designed, while the bright living area opens directly onto a private south-west facing patio overlooking the beautifully maintained communal gardens.\nThe principal bedroom is a generously sized double room featuring floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking the front of the property and benefits from an en-suite bathroom. The second bedroom, also a double room features floor-to ceiling windows overlooking the front of Mount Saint Anne's. The property also offers two allocated secure private parking spaces in the underground garage along with ample visitor bays.\n\nIdeally positioned in Milltown, Dublin 6, residents enjoy a wealth of local amenities on their doorstep, including excellent cafés, restaurants, shops, educational facilities and sporting amenities, all within walking distance. The development is exceptionally well served by public transport, with the LUAS being just a 10-minute walk away and accessed via a private resident's gate, and bus routes conveniently located directly outside the development, providing swift and easy access to Dublin City centre and beyond.\n\nNo. 45 offers a broad appeal to a variety of purchasers, from those seeking to right-size, to first-time buyers and investors a-like looking to benefit from the area's strong and consistent rental demand."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 4.47m x 2.94m\nWith wooden flooring, recessed lighting, wall-mounted storage unit and intercom.\n\nBathroom - 2.20m x 1.81m\nWith tiled floors, recessed lighting, partially tiled walls, toilet, wash-hand basin, under sink storage. Includes bath with overhead shower attachment, heated towel rail and wall-mounted mirror.\n\nBedroom 1 - 5.05m x 4.07m\nA generous double room with carpet flooring, integrated storage, recessed lighting, and floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking the front of the property.\n\nEn Suite - 1.79m x 2.38m\nWith tiled floors, recessed lighting, Dimplex fan, toilet, wash-hand basin with under sink storage, heated towel rail and wall mounted mirror. Includes shower unit with tiled walls and Grohe shower attachment.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.47m x 2.94m\nA spacious double room with carpet floors, recessed lighting, built-in wardrobes, and floor-to-ceiling windows overlooking the front of the property.\n\nKitchen - 2.11m x 3.12m\nTiled floors and recessed lighting. Includes an array of built-in kitchen units with metal splash back and integrated appliances such as Whirlpool oven, NEFF hob, CATA extractor fan, Electrolux washing machine, Beko dishwasher and Electrolux fridge-freezer.\n\nLiving Room - 7.34m x 4.05m\nWooden flooring, recessed lighting and floor-to-ceiling windows and door to patio overlooking the communal gardens.\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>South facing private patio</li><li>Two allocated secure underground parking spaces</li><li>Private resident's access to LUAS</li><li>Close proximity to Milltown and Ranelagh Villages</ul>"
      },
